<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">-Yemsa New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Filmona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filmonani matsafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filmona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil.</para>
  <para style="mt2">Wosi Phawulosni wosiya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filmonanik</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gachgiru</para>
  <para style="ip">Filmona arto kiristana; Qolasiyasni betekiristaniissi fe baassoneen ane feenamatotu biistefa. Filmona Onesmos yiste bozba feer. Es wostinynyaas daambaaskin kesse hamna kaba taatoni keer fe Phawulosneen uphe. Phawulosniki kamo Onesmos kiristinnani amantooson ephphete. Phawulos Filmonaniki tichina wosiyaas Filmona wolle barki yeere ganonak besifar. Es baristan dey hash Onesmos kiristana sinna boor'a hawungneen ekalo kiristana aynimato ephphetoonaktano boznimato faadunoynamato make.</para>
  <para style="iot">Matsafaas Siruk Ephna Ephobaas</para>
  <para style="io1">Gachgiru <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawulosni galata Filmonanik <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawulos Onesmosni chowaasik zaggire shiiphe <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Koor'uba <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Kiristoos Yesusni chowaasik taato sina Phawulosnikinnawa ayni sina Ximotiyosnikinna; shunto aynisiknawa innoneen ane wostefe Filmonanikna: <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>Esiisimato dey neeki keer zuuttesefe amanynyini meyak eetni sina Afibiyak innoneen ane Kiristoosni meya taar'o sina Arkiphanik; <verse eid="PHM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Aba Ha'oniiskin; Daamni Yesus Kiristoosni otmaasewa nagaase nittok sinfawung.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filmonani Keeshtannewa Amantone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Shiiphonaasik neen safaret wonna wonna Ha'onaason galattefawungwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>Daamni Yesusniista fa amantonesewa amanynyini meyak fa keeshtanneese asin odengwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Kiristoosnir sinniisik danni ma'a wuzaas zuuttera ammanon arutak amantoneeson oomni meya haa'ak chimatak shiiphefawungwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Aytaaso! Amanynyini meeni nibaas neyista beysa danna boor'a keeshtanneestan taak akama giranewa chimne daningwa.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Onesmosni Chowaasik Wolle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Es bari boor'a wostoneeson koi'suwa yira neen ajajok Kiristoosniki kamo chima daningwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>Sinfanaknu es baron zagustan Yesus Kiristoosni chowaasik taato sina ta kur'u Phawulos keeshtanak shiiphosontu sholefawungwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>Ta taatoni keer faagedo danna naata sina Onesmosni chowaasik neen shiiphefawungwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Zeemo sinak Onesmos neek ke'nor sinne feer; sinuntano hash neeknen taakneen ke'nirwa.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Barin neeki wolgira wosingwa; barin neeki wosinaas ta nibaasi safaranon zaguni asunin zagiratu faadifawungwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Misirachchuni kaamaasi boor'a taatera faana kabaasik ne edde sinne taan argasunak bar taneen ane feefaanane girona kabawa. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Sinuntano ne zagifata ma'a wostoos shunaktano giddik sinnoynamato iyaat neneen ane merkonoy isa wuzane zaguk aane sholotwa.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Onesmos garo wonniron neyistan oor kesnaas awuzakne hawungneen ekalo neyistan oor kesnoy neneen ane foona sinanawa. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Sinuntano hawungneen ekalo bar neneen ane foonaas boznimato sinnoynaron boziisatan denalo shunto ay sinnewa. Bar taak shunto aytawa; sinuntano ashak feena kabaasik wostefena wostoos neek ke'nir sinna boor'a ayyanabaasik dey Kiristoosniki kamo ayne sinna boor'a neek arkiron shuntowa.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Ese taan ay zagira faaditannen barin dey tane feer zagira ephphatowa. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Bar neen miir'ena wuza wedey kowa faafaanane tayista faaduwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Ta Phawulos kowaason neek kaasuna yira kushunaasik neek tichingwa. Sinfanak kaaneesi chowak nenu teetneesik ta kowa neyista faanamato ta neen yaadassunak aane sholsifawa. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Ese aytaaso! Han ma'a wuzason taak zagutak Daamiisa sunak shiiphefawungwa. Adarawa Kiristoosniki kamo nibnaasik beysa imaywa. <verse eid="PHM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Han baron neek tichinaas ma'i utar sinneeson amanefaatwa. Ta neen mamsinaastan denalo zagutamato arifawungwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Es baristan denalo Ha'oos shiiphontiison odera nittoki yoonak zagunak abdina faar sinna boor'a beysa ephana keya taak hoossuwa.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Koi'ni Nagani Ooshsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Kiristoos Yesusni boor'a taneen ane taatere fe Ephphafira neek naga wosiwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Esiisimato dey taneen ane wostesefe meya: Marqos, Aristirokos, Deemasnawa Luqasna naga neek wossetewa. <verse eid="PHM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Daamni Yesus Kiristoosni otmaas nittoneen ane sinfawungwa.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
